{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2025-02/1065464/block/singleImage/3276647/df/ojpb728t9kff_1.JPG?updatedAt=1795513992\"/><figcaption>昂坪360纜車女童一度暈倒，直升機救起送院檢查。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (24 日 ) 下午 3 時許，警方接獲報案，指一名 1 歲半大的女嬰在昂坪 360 纜車上暈倒失去知覺。救援人員接報後到場，隨即替她進行急救，其後恢復清醒，並由飛行服務隊直升機送往東區醫院檢查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T10:44:06.206910+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T09:11:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T11:17:17.943215+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T10:37:16.714622+00:00","content_hash":"56b5fb8019150565a016bc86970237430a0ab3ea107d04a3b8dd1284e08d9880","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}